:R-HSA-5693606  a           obo:GO_0006302 , owl:NamedIndividual ;
        rdfs:comment        "DNA double-strand break (DSB) response involves sensing of DNA DSBs by the MRN complex which triggers ATM activation. ATM phosphorylates a number of proteins involved in DNA damage checkpoint signaling, as well as proteins directly involved in the repair of DNA DSBs. For a recent review, please refer to Ciccia and Elledge, 2010." ;
        rdfs:label          "DNA Double Strand Break Response" ;
